	(text "Start LED: D13 HIGH = on (also onboard LED).\n12 V LED from +12V_FUSED, NOT +12V_SW:\nit must blink while motor power is cut.\nQ1 GND to Mega GND. Gate pull-down: check\nthe module has one, else 10k gate to GND.\nLance fault 500/500 ms, other 2000/2000 ms."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 339.09 0)
		(effects
